oard data lost'                                                   MSKN0010= 'HOT     '           / Name for mask plane 10                         MSKM0010=                 1024 / Bitmask for plane n=10; always 1<<n            MSKD0010= 'Hot pixel'                                                           MSKN0011= 'COLD    '           / Name for mask plane 11                         MSKM0011=                 2048 / Bitmask for plane n=11; always 1<<n            MSKD0011= 'Anomalously low signal'                                              MSKN0012= 'FULLSAMPLE'         / Name for mask plane 12                         MSKM0012=                 4096 / Bitmask for plane n=12; always 1<<n            MSKD0012= 'Pixel full sample history is available'                              MSKN0014= 'PHANMISS'           / Name for mask plane 14                         MSKM0014=                16384 / Bitmask for plane n=14; always 1<<n            MSKD0014= 'Phantom correction was not applied'                                  MSKN0015= 'NONLINEAR'          / Name for mask plane 15                         MSKM0015=                32768 / Bitmask for plane n=15; always 1<<n            MSKD0015= 'Nonlinearity correction cannot be applied reliably'                  MSKN0017= 'PERSIST '           / Name for mask plane 17                         MSKM0017=               131072 / Bitmask for plane n=17; always 1<<n            MSKD0017= 'Persistent charge above threshold'                                   MSKN0019= 'OUTLIER '           / Name for mask plane 19                         MSKM0019=               524288 / Bitmask for plane n=19; always 1<<n            MSKD0019= 'Pixel flagged by Detect Outliers'                                    MSKN0020= 'CROSSTALK'          / Name for mask plane 20                         MSKM0020=              1048576 / Bitmask for plane n=20; always 1<<n            MSKD0020= 'Pixel affected by crosstalk.'                                        MSKN0021= 'SOU